A NOTE ON THE UNDERLYING SOURCES

This license covers this repository's own writing, structure and figures. It
does not and cannot cover the third-party material the work cites. Company
filings, regulatory documents and vendor datasets quoted or tabulated here
remain the property of their publishers and are used here as citation and
commentary. Every one of them is linked in the Evidence and sources section, so
you can go to the original rather than trusting this synthesis.
